  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-IADB" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-American Development Bank</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Plan Familias I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Plan Familias I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa es contribuir al aumento de las capacidades de las familias estructuralmente pobres mediante el uso de subsidios monetarios condicionados. El programa focalizar en los hogares estructuralmente pobres y transferira los subsidios a cambio de corresponsabilidades asociadas a acciones de salud, educacin y capacitacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will be divided into three components:
Component 1. Conditional cash transfers. The program will finance conditional cash transfers for poor families.
Component 2. Non-monetary subsidies. Two activities will be financed: (i) workshops regarding adult education, nutrition, infant work eradication, health, and social organization and (ii) after school programs for children.
Component 3. Institutional Strengthening: The development and strengthening of the following systems will be financed: (i) control of conditionalities and registry, (ii) subsidy payment, (iii) monitoring, (iv) evaluation and (v) social risks.</narrative>
  </description>
